    <ferc:Remarks id="f-824" contextRef="c-135">NA</ferc:Remarks>
    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-826" contextRef="c-51">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-left: 22.75pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 20.55pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;SUMMARY OF SIGNIFICANT ACCOUNTING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;POLICIES&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Nature of Operations&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.3pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Citizens S-Line Transmission, LLC (CSLT or the Company) was formed on May 12, 2020, and is owned 100% by Citizens Enterprises Corporation (Parent). The Company leases one-hundred percent (100%) of the incremental transfer capability created by the S-Line Upgrade (as compared to the transfer capability prior to giving effect to the S-Line Upgrade) and fifty percent (50%) of the incremental transfer capability created by transformer upgrades at El Centro switching station. The S- Line is an 18.1 mile, 230 kV electric transmission line owned by Imperial Irrigation District (IID) that runs from IID's El Centro switching station to the Imperial Valley substation that is jointly owned by IID and San Diego Gas &amp;amp; Electric (SDG&amp;amp;E). IID is solely responsible for overseeing and performing all operations and maintenance services for the S-Line project. The Company is not responsible, and will not reimburse &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;IID, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for any ongoing operations and maintenance costs. All of the Company's revenues are from the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) approved Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Revenue Requirement (TRR) tariff and are collected by the California Independent System Operator (ISO) from users of the transmission line and remitted to the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Use of Estimates&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.4pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The preparation of financial statements in conformity with accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America requires management to make estimates and assumptions that affect certain reported amounts and disclosures. Accordingly, actual results could differ from those&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 1.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;estimates.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Accounts Receivable and the Allowance for Credit Losses&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.35pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company leases a transmission line and derives its revenue from a FERC-approved TTR tariff, which is collected by the California ISO from users and remitted monthly to the Company and due in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30 days. Accounts receivable are stated at the contractual amount billed to the customer. The Company recognized an allowance for losses on accounts receivable in an amount equal to current expected credit losses. The estimation of the allowance is based on an analysis of historical loss experience, current receivables aging, and management's assessment of current conditions and reasonable and supportable expectation of future conditions, as well as an assessment of specific identifiable customer accounts considered at risk or uncollectible. The Company assesses collectability by pooling receivables where similar characteristics exist and evaluates receivables individually when a specific customer balance no longer shares those risk characteristics and are considered a risk or uncollectible. The expense associated with the allowance for expected credit losses is included in general and administrative expenses.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.35pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company has elected an accounting policy to consider subsequent collection activity in measuring expected credit losses. Accordingly, trade receivables that are collected in full after the balance sheet date, but before the date the financial statements are available to be issued are excluded from the credit loss measurement.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.35pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.35pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Receivables are written off when information indicates the debtor is experiencing significant financial difficulty and recovery is no longer considered possible. Recoveries of amounts previously written off are recognized in income or as an offset to credit loss expense in the period recovered. Credit losses are expected to be minimal. Accordingly, no provision for credit losses has been included in the financial statements.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-left: 22.75pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 28.8pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Concentration of Credit Risk&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.5pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Revenues are derived through the TRR which is collected by the California ISO. During the years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, 100% of the Company's revenue and 100% of the accounts receivable balance at December 31, 2025 and 2024, were derived from the California&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISO.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Fair Value of Financial Instruments&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.4pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company's financial instruments consist of cash, cash held in escrow, accounts receivable, accounts payable and accrued expenses, and debt instruments. The carrying values of cash, cash held in escrow, accounts receivable, and accounts payable and accrued expenses are generally considered to be representative of their respective fair values because of their short-term nature. The carrying values of the Company's debt instruments approximate their fair values as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, based on the incremental borrowing rates for similar types of borrowing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;arrangements.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company recognizes the provision of transmission services in accordance with the TRR as an operating lease with payments depending on the transmission facility being under the operational control of the California ISO. The Company recognizes rental revenue which is shown in the accompanying financial statements as electric revenue while the transmission facility is under the operational control of the California ISO during the term of the lease. The Company's revenue does not fall under the guidance of ASU 2014-09, Revenue from Contracts with Customers (Topic 606) because the standard explicitly excludes lease-based income.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Deferred Finance Charges&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Interest Topic of the FASB Accounting Standards Codification requires the Company to present deferred finance charges as a reduction of the carrying amount of the debt rather than as an asset (see Note 4). The costs are amortized using the interest method over the life of the debt. Amortization of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt issuance costs of approximately $32,000 and $16,000 was charged to interest expense for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. Amortization of deferred finance charges is expected to be approximately $32,000 per year for the next five&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;years.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Prepaid Operating Lease Right-of-Use Asset&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.4pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company leases the transfer capability of a transmission line that is owned by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;IID, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;located in California's Imperial Valley. On July 1, 2024, CSLT paid for the 40-year transmission line lease with IID at inception of the lease agreement and is amortizing it on a straight-line basis over the term of the arrangement. The prepaid operating lease right-of-use asset (ROU) is included in current assets and other assets on the Company's balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;sheets.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;An ROU asset represents the Company's right to use the underlying asset for the lease term. The entire lease obligation was paid-in-full at inception, therefore there is no recognition of a lease liability. Lease expense will be recognized on a straight-line basis over the lease term and the lease does not contain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;any renewal options. The Company does not anticipate that it will need to enter any new leases in the foreseeable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;future.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Regulatory Asset&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.4pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;CSLT is a regulated entity and, in appropriate circumstances, establishes regulatory assets or liabilities, and thereby defers the statement of operations impact of certain charges or revenues because it is probable to be collected or refunded through future customer billings as required by the Accounting of Certain Types of Regulation Topic of the FASB Accounting Standards Codification. During 2024, CSLT received regulatory approval from the FERC to capitalize development costs associated with setting up the CSLT transmission project. CSLT is amortizing these costs over the forty-year life of the lease and are reimbursed through the TRR. The over-collections of TRR tariffs are returned to rate payers in future rate filings and are classified as a regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;liability.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.15pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Allocation of Profits, Losses, and Member Distributions&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Profits or losses from operations of the Company, along with gains and losses from the sale, exchange, or other disposition of Company property and tax credits shall be allocated annually to the sole member in accordance with the operating agreement. Net cash flow available for distribution will be paid to the sole member after all conditions contained within the operating agreement have been satisfied.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Cash Flow Information&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.4pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company considers all highly liquid debt instruments purchased with a maturity of three months or less to be cash equivalents.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0.4pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Supplemental disclosure of cash flow information:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 53.05pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 11.95pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 104.3pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 53.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.85pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 32.2pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 25.65pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 31.25pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.3pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Cash paid during the years for:&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 52.85pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.35pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Income taxes&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 104.3pt; border-top: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.1pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 5.35pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 12.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 58.1pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.85pt; border-top: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.1pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 12.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 58.1pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 20.85pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-left: 52.85pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Interest&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 104.3pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-right: 5.35pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.45pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;3,129,303&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.85pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-right: 2.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 58.1pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 45.2pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 7.5pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Cash and Cash Held in Escrow&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Cash and cash held in escrow consist of the following:&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 104.3pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 53.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.05pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.85pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 32.2pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.3pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 25.25pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 52.85pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Cash&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 104.3pt; border-top: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.2pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 5.35pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 22.2pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2,364,057&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.85pt; border-top: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 32.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1pt"&gt; 							&lt;img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAYAAAA5Ht7JAAAABHNCSVQICAgIfAhkiAAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAACRJREFUGJVjZGBgeMNAf7CWgYEhnYGBgYGFgYGBZwAcIApjAACIBAIntbgWYQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="32" height="2" alt="" /&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.1pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-right: 2.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 22.2pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2,525,601&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.4pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 52.85pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Cash held in escrow&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 104.3pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 5.35pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.4pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;1,642,089&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.85pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.4pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;1,632,881&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 120pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.5pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Total cash and cash held in escrow shown on the&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 127.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;statements of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;flows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 115.36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.5pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;4,006,146&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 11.05pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.5pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;4,158,482&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.6pt 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Amounts included in cash held in escrow represents cash held in a separate account under the terms of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a loan agreement with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a lender. This lender restriction will lapse when the related long-term debt is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;paid off.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.35pt; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company is a single-member limited liability company. Therefore, the Company is not liable for federal and state income taxes. All items of income and expense are reflected on the income tax return of its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;member.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.5pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company has evaluated subsequent events through April 7, 2026, which is the date the financial statements were available to be issued. No significant matters were identified for disclosure during this evaluation.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 69.6pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-indent: -18pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.75pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;PREPAID OPERATING LEASE RIGHT-OF-USE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.25pt; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;ASSET&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On July 1, 2024, CSLT prepaid $40,000,000 for the lease rights to the transfer capability of the S-Line Transmission line from IID, which is an upgraded 230 kV S-Line single circuit to a steel tower construction with thermal rating sufficient to support the increased capacity needed for the upgraded El Centro transformer. The 18.1 mile transmission line runs from the El Centro switching station to the Imperial Valley substation.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Amortization for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 amounted to approximately $1,000,000 and $500,000, respectively, and is included in rent expense on the statements of operations and member's equity (deficit). Amortization of the prepaid lease for the next five years is expected to be approximately $1,000,000 per year. Prepaid operating lease ROU asset at December 31, 2025 and 2024 consists of the following.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.1pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 426pt; margin-left: 81.85pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 18.7pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 256.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 89.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 39pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.2pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.8pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 32.25pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.2pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 18.85pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 256.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6.05pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Prepaid operating lease ROU asset, current portion&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 89.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6.05pt; margin-right: 5.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 22.2pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1,000,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.8pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6.05pt; margin-right: 2.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 22.2pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1,000,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 256.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Prepaid operating lease ROU asset, noncurrent portion&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 89.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 5.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;37,500,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.8pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;38,500,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.4pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 256.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 89.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 5.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;38,500,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.8pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;39,500,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-left: 69.6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.75pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;REGULATORY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;ASSET&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On January 28, 2022, the FERC conditionally accepted in Docket No. ER 21-2082-000 the CSLT tariff and revenue requirement, which included the capitalization of development costs related to CSLT. The FERC approval was subject to a compliance filing to provide the actual cost data. The FERC Order allows amortization of development costs into rates over the forty year life of the lease. On December 20, 2024, the FERC accepted in Docket No. ER 21-2082-003 the CSLT compliance filing, which included capitalization of approximately $2,311,000 of development costs related to CSLT. The compliance filing was accepted effective July 1, 2024, the date the project became operational.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.15pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Amortization for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 amounted to approximately $58,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and $29,000, respectively. The annual amortization of development costs for the next five years will be approximately $58,000 per year. Regulatory asset at December 31, 2025 and 2024 consist of the following:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.35pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 41.85pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 				&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 60.75pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-right: 18.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Regulatory asset,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 122.17pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36.05pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;57,779&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 11pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36.05pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;57,779&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 18.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Regulatory asset,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;noncurrent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 111.22pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.45pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2,166,699&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 16.6pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.45pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;2,224,478&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 18.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.45pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2,224,478&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 11.05pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 19.5pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;2,282,257&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 490.9pt; margin-left: 20.65pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 19.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 326.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.2pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 20.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;LONG-TERM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;DEBT&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 164.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 32.35pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 326.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6.95pt; margin-left: 31.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Long-term debt consisted of the following at December 31:&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 82.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin: 0 29.35pt 0 29.4pt; text-align: center; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin: 0 28.2pt 0 29.45pt; text-align: center; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 94.5pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 326.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin: 0 3.45pt 0 31.25pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;On July 3, 2024, CSLT issued $45,200,000 of Senior Secured Notes with a 5.95% interest rate. The notes call for semi-annual payments of approximately $1,625,000, that begin on March 1, 2025, and include interest through September 2054. The notes are secured by a first priority security interest in all of CSLT's assets and are not cross-collateralized or guaranteed by any affiliate of the Company (effective interest rate is 6.04%).&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 82.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 7.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 16.65pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;44,632,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 3.6pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 16.7pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;45,200,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 36pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 326.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin: 6.05pt 1.45pt 0 31.25pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Unamortized debt issuance costs on the above senior secured notes.&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 82.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 3.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 24pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;(905,446&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 24pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;(937,216&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 17.05pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 326.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 82.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.25pt; margin-right: 7.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;43,726,554&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.25pt; margin-right: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;44,262,784&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 326.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 67.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Less current portion&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 82.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 7.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.7pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;602,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 9.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.7pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;568,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 13.45pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 326.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.8pt; margin-left: 67.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.65pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Long-term debt, less current portion&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 82.75pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 7.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 12.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;43,124,554&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 3.6pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.95pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;43,694,784&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Principal payments on long-term debt are as follows for the years ending December 31:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 225.85pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.4pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2026&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 30.45pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;602,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2027&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;639,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2028&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;677,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.55pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2029&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;718,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;2030&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;761,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Thereafter&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;41,235,000&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Unamortized debt issuance costs&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.6pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 24pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;(905,446&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12.4pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 177.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 108.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.1pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;43,726,554&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-indent: -18pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.75pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;LOW-INCOME ASSISTANCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;ACTIVITIES&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.3pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;During 2024, Citizens Energy Corporation (the Parent Company), on behalf of CSLT, began a program that provides assistance to low-income families in the Imperial Valley of California. The program aims to benefit low-income, underserved, and disadvantaged communities in Imperial County. The funding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of the program will be provided by CSLT pursuant to its agreement with Imperial Irrigation District to apply one-half of CSLT's adjusted profits derived from the S-Line Upgrade Project to this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;purpose.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The funding obligations for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, amounted to approximately&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$695,000 and $214,000, respectively, and was recorded in general and administrative expenses in the accompanying statements of operations and member's equity (deficit). As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the accrued low-income assistance payable amounted to approximately $443,000 and $214,000, respectively.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-indent: -18pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;6.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.75pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;RELATED PARTY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgba(15, 71, 97, 1)"&gt;TRANSACTIONS&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Under an administrative service agreement entered into between the Company and Citizens Enterprises Corporation, certain management and administrative services were provided to the Company. For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the aggregate fees charged to the Company were approximately $247,000 and $107,000, respectively. Amounts outstanding in the balance sheets at December 31, 2025 and 2024, were approximately $154,000 and $107,000, respectively.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
    <ferc:MiscellaneousPaidInCapital id="f-828" contextRef="c-72" unitRef="u-3" decimals="0">0</ferc:MiscellaneousPaidInCapital>
